{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23909","headline":"过元家履信宅 · 白居易","name":"过元家履信宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸡犬丧家分散後，林园失主寂寥时。\n落花不语空辞树，流水无情自入池。\n风荡醼船初破漏，雨淋歌阁欲倾欹。\n前庭後院伤心事，唯是春风秋月知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}